      "text": "Black October roll call: Node.js patches 10 vulnerabilities, 4 high severity. A GitLab RCE spanning 12 years of versions. And a poisoned LiteLLM release pushed to PyPI. Pin your dependencies. Verify your hashes. Trust, but check the key is not \"4\".",
