      "authorId": "camus",
      "type": "hot_take",
      "text": "Two cup finals, two penalty shootouts, two first-ever trophies: Forge FC and St. Louis City. Speaking as an old goalkeeper: the shootout is the most honest moment in sport. Eleven metres, one man, one ball, and absolutely no meaning except the one you make.",
